---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<section class="process" aria-labelledby="process-title">
  <div class="process__intro">
    <p class="process__badge"><Icon name="lucide:trophy" class="process__badge-icon" /> Process</p>
    <h2 id="process-title">How the process flows with clarity</h2>
    <p class="process__description">
      A clear and collaborative workflow that moves each project from first idea to polished, production-ready result.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class="timeline" aria-label="Project process timeline">
    <li class="timeline__item timeline__item--card">
      <span class="timeline__icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="lucide:search" /></span>
      <h3>Discovery</h3>
      <p>
        We start by understanding your goals, users, technical requirements, and the direction your project should take.
      </p>
    </li>

    <li class="timeline__item timeline__item--card">
      <span class="timeline__icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="lucide:compass" /></span>
      <h3>Strategy</h3>
      <p>
        I define the architecture, tech stack, and development approach before writing any code.
      </p>
    </li>

    <li class="timeline__item timeline__item--card">
      <span class="timeline__icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="lucide:pencil-ruler" /></span>
      <h3>Design & Planning</h3>
      <p>
        System design, data models, and API contracts are shaped with clear technical direction.
      </p>
    </li>

    <li class="timeline__item">
      <span class="timeline__icon timeline__icon--flat" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="lucide:code-2" /></span>
      <h3>Development</h3>
      <p>
        Clean, tested code is built iteratively with regular check-ins and transparent progress.
      </p>
    </li>

    <li class="timeline__item">
      <span class="timeline__icon timeline__icon--flat" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="lucide:shield-check" /></span>
      <h3>Testing & QA</h3>
      <p>
        Thorough testing, performance optimization, and security review before launch.
      </p>
    </li>

    <li class="timeline__item">
      <span class="timeline__icon timeline__icon--flat" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="lucide:rocket" /></span>
      <h3>Delivery</h3>
      <p>
        Deployment, documentation, and handoff — everything ready for production.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .process {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #f4f2ed;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 34px);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 26px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .process__badge {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #e4e1da;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .process__intro h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Lora Variable", "Lora", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.06;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    max-width: 15ch;
    color: #151515;
  }

  .process__description {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: #5f5f5f;
    line-height: 1.56;
    max-width: 46ch;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .timeline {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 0 30px;
    border-left: 1px solid #ddd8cf;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .timeline__item {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0 0 2px;
  }

  .timeline__item h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1f1f1f;
  }

  .timeline__item p {
    margin: 7px 0 0;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  .process__badge-icon {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    vertical-align: -2px;
  }

  .timeline__icon {
    position: absolute;
    left: -48px;
    top: -2px;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid #d8d3ca;
    background: #ffffff;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: #424242;
  }

  .timeline__icon :global(svg) {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }

  .timeline__item--card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e1d9;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 14px 14px 14px 16px;
  }

  .timeline__icon--flat {
    background: transparent;
    border-color: #d8d3ca;
  }

  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .process {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .process__intro h2 {
      max-width: 20ch;
    }
  }
</style>
